doc:sch-1-sec-17 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17 Subsection 6(1)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Insert: health service means:  (a) an activity performed in relation to an individual that is intended or claimed (expressly or otherwise) by the individual or the person performing it:  (i) to assess, record, maintain or improve the individual’s health; or  (ii) to diagnose the individual’s illness or disability; or  (iii) to treat the individual’s illness or disability or suspected illness or disability; or  (b) the dispensing on prescription of a drug or medicinal preparation by a pharmacist." ;
    cof:pageNumber "13"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19 Subsection 6(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-19 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: media organisation means an organisation whose activities consist of or include the collection, preparation for dissemination or dissemination of the following material for the purpose of making it available to the public:  (a) material having the character of news, current affairs, information or a documentary;  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (b) material consisting of commentary or opinion on, or analysis of, news, current affairs, information or a documentary." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: media organisation means an organisation whose activities consist of or include the collection, preparation for dissemination or dissemination of the following material for the purpose of making it available to the public:  (a) material having the character of news, current affairs, information or a documentary;  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (b) material consisting of commentary or opinion on, or analysis of, news, current affairs, information or a documentary."@en ;
