    values:originalText "record) Insert:  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (fa) records (as defined in the Archives Act 1983) in the custody of the Archives (as defined in that Act) in relation to which the Archives has entered into arrangements with a person other than a Commonwealth institution (as defined in that Act) providing for the extent to which the Archives or other persons are to have access to the records; or" ;
    skos:definition "record) Insert:  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (fa) records (as defined in the Archives Act 1983) in the custody of the Archives (as defined in that Act) in relation to which the Archives has entered into arrangements with a person other than a Commonwealth institution (as defined in that Act) providing for the extent to which the Archives or other persons are to have access to the records; or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8155d699b888c42a23017494c91a73bba15f252abd7a213abcee319f93f50fda" ;
    cof:pageNumber "14"^^xsd:integer ;
