    cof:title "34 At the end of subsection 6(7)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Add:  ; or (c) being both a file number complaint and a code complaint; or  (d) being both a file number complaint and an NPP complaint; or  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (e) being both a code complaint and a credit reporting complaint; or  (f) being both an NPP complaint and a credit reporting complaint." ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-35 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35 Subsection 6(8)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-35 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (8) For the purposes of this Act, the question whether bodies corporate are related to each other is determined in the manner in which that question is determined under the Corporations Law.  (9) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of this Act, services provided to an agency or a State or Territory authority include services that consist of the provision of services to other persons in connection with the performance of the functions of the agency or State or Territory authority." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (8) For the purposes of this Act, the question whether bodies corporate are related to each other is determined in the manner in which that question is determined under the Corporations Law.  (9) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of this Act, services provided to an agency or a State or Territory authority include services that consist of the provision of services to other persons in connection with the performance of the functions of the agency or State or Territory authority."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fc61fc4a50e655d12b70c909f99174b3a8932dca19bfcf9d8128e3cad72db45b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
