doc:sch-1-sec-6a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6A(3) Breach of a National Privacy Principle" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) An act or practice does not breach a National Privacy Principle if the act or practice involves the disclosure by an organisation of personal information in a record (as defined in the Archives Act 1983) solely for the purposes of enabling the Archives (as defined in that Act) to decide whether to accept, or to arrange, custody of the record. No breach—act or practice outside Australia" ;
