doc:sch-1-sec-6d-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6D(3) Small business and small business operators" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A small business operator is an individual, body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust that:  (a) carries on one or more small businesses; and  (b) does not carry on a business that is not a small business. Entities that are not small business operators" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6D(4) Small business and small business operators"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6d-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, an individual, body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust is not a small business operator if he, she or it:  (a) carries on a business that has had an annual turnover of more than $3,000,000 for a financial year that has ended after the later of the following:  (i) the time he, she or it started to carry on the business;  (ii) the commencement of this section; or  (b) provides a health service to another individual and holds any health information except in an employee record; or  (c) discloses personal information about another individual to anyone else for a benefit, service or advantage; or  (d) provides a benefit, service or advantage to collect personal information about another individual from anyone else; or  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (e) is a contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract (whether or not a party to the contract). Private affairs of small business operators who are individuals" ;
    skos:definition "(4) However, an individual, body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust is not a small business operator if he, she or it:  (a) carries on a business that has had an annual turnover of more than $3,000,000 for a financial year that has ended after the later of the following:  (i) the time he, she or it started to carry on the business;  (ii) the commencement of this section; or  (b) provides a health service to another individual and holds any health information except in an employee record; or  (c) discloses personal information about another individual to anyone else for a benefit, service or advantage; or  (d) provides a benefit, service or advantage to collect personal information about another individual from anyone else; or  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (e) is a contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract (whether or not a party to the contract). Private affairs of small business operators who are individuals"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "de135a55303690ce8be7d776678bb25e456946c9505a915b45446c5d40bfacc8" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts certain individuals and entities from being considered small business operators." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf> ;
