doc:sch-1-sec-6d-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6D(4) Small business and small business operators" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, an individual, body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust is not a small business operator if he, she or it:  (a) carries on a business that has had an annual turnover of more than $3,000,000 for a financial year that has ended after the later of the following:  (i) the time he, she or it started to carry on the business;  (ii) the commencement of this section; or  (b) provides a health service to another individual and holds any health information except in an employee record; or  (c) discloses personal information about another individual to anyone else for a benefit, service or advantage; or  (d) provides a benefit, service or advantage to collect personal information about another individual from anyone else; or  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (e) is a contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract (whether or not a party to the contract). Private affairs of small business operators who are individuals" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6D(5) Small business and small business operators"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6d-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Subsection (4) does not prevent an individual from being a small business operator merely because he or she does something described in paragraph (4)(b), (c) or (d):  (a) otherwise than in the course of a business he or she carries on; and  (b) only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her personal, family or household affairs. Non-business affairs of other small business operators" ;
    skos:definition "(5) Subsection (4) does not prevent an individual from being a small business operator merely because he or she does something described in paragraph (4)(b), (c) or (d):  (a) otherwise than in the course of a business he or she carries on; and  (b) only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her personal, family or household affairs. Non-business affairs of other small business operators"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "93b653a8042b394bc65e0a132d2f057eadfe0c4cf45918cced523a55d091fb32" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts individuals from being a small business operator under certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
