    values:originalText "(5) Subsection (4) does not prevent an individual from being a small business operator merely because he or she does something described in paragraph (4)(b), (c) or (d):  (a) otherwise than in the course of a business he or she carries on; and  (b) only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her personal, family or household affairs. Non-business affairs of other small business operators" ;
