doc:sch-1-sec-6d-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6D(6) Small business and small business operators" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subsection (4) does not prevent a body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust from being a small business operator merely because it does something described in paragraph (4)(b), (c) or (d) otherwise than in the course of a business it carries on. Disclosure compelled or made with consent" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6D(7) Small business and small business operators"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6d-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Paragraph (4)(c) does not prevent an individual, body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust from being a small business operator only because he, she or it discloses personal information about another individual:  (a) with the consent of the other individual; or  (b) as required or authorised by or under legislation. Collection with consent or under legislation" ;
    skos:definition "(7) Paragraph (4)(c) does not prevent an individual, body corporate, partnership, unincorporated association or trust from being a small business operator only because he, she or it discloses personal information about another individual:  (a) with the consent of the other individual; or  (b) as required or authorised by or under legislation. Collection with consent or under legislation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cb7d95d0bf9f67ac9d911bca6a31700e510c88fb4d27d0c7e7a479e40656cd1d" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosure of personal information is permitted with consent or under legislation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
