doc:sch-1-sec-6ea-ss-6 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6EA(6) Small business operators choosing to be treated as" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) The Commissioner must make the register available to the public in the way that the Commissioner determines. However, the Commissioner must not make available to the public in the register information other than that described in subsection (3)." ;
