doc:sch-1-sec-7a-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7A(3) Acts of certain agencies treated as acts of organisation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (1) also applies to acts and practices that:  (a) are done or engaged in by an agency specified in Division 1 of Part II of Schedule 2 to the Freedom of Information Act 1982 in relation to documents in respect of its commercial activities or the commercial activities of another entity; and  (b) relate to those commercial activities." ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

