doc:sch-1-sec-7b-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "7B(4) Exempt acts and exempt practices of organisations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) An act done, or practice engaged in, by a media organisation is exempt for the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee) if the act is done, or the practice is engaged in:  (a) by the organisation in the course of journalism; and  (b) at a time when the organisation is publicly committed to observe standards that:  (i) deal with privacy in the context of the activities of a media organisation (whether or not the standards also deal with other matters); and  (ii) have been published in writing by the organisation or a person or body representing a class of media organisations. Organisation acting under State contract" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-7b-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "7B(5) Exempt acts and exempt practices of organisations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-7b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) An act done, or practice engaged in, by an organisation is exempt for the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee) if:  (a) the organisation is a contracted service provider for a State contract (whether or not the organisation is a party to the contract); and  (b) the act is done, or the practice is engaged in for the purposes of meeting (directly or indirectly) an obligation under the contract." ;
    skos:definition "(5) An act done, or practice engaged in, by an organisation is exempt for the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee) if:  (a) the organisation is a contracted service provider for a State contract (whether or not the organisation is a party to the contract); and  (b) the act is done, or the practice is engaged in for the purposes of meeting (directly or indirectly) an obligation under the contract."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0ccb310ae6c2438eed6aa0f87118dcc0e6f0abcd094d16a01a88fc9ee859320a" ;
