doc:sch-1-sec-13b-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "13B(1A) Related bodies corporate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) However, paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to the collection by a body corporate of personal information (other than sensitive information) from:  (a) a related body corporate that is not an organisation; or  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (b) a related body corporate whose disclosure of the information to the body corporate is an exempt act or exempt practice for the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee); or  (c) a related body corporate whose disclosure of the information to the body corporate is not an interference with privacy because of section 13D. Note: The effect of subsection (1A) is that a body corporate’s failure to comply with the National Privacy Principles, or a binding approved privacy code, in collecting personal information about an individual from a related body corporate covered by that subsection is an interference with the privacy of the individual. Relationship with paragraphs 13A(1)(c) and (d)" ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-13b-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "13B(2) Related bodies corporate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-13b-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not prevent an act or practice of an organisation from being an interference with the privacy of an individual under paragraph 13A(1)(c) or (d)." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Subsection (1) does not prevent an act or practice of an organisation from being an interference with the privacy of an individual under paragraph 13A(1)(c) or (d)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "acbf0b81a026fb093e1c3ed4217f621c0976879fdfc739d77b390789fb9a697e" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-13b ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Organisation's act or practice may interfere with individual's privacy." ;
