    cof:title "16D(4) Delayed application of National Privacy Principles to small" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) National Privacy Principles 2 and 6 apply only in relation to personal information collected by the organisation after the delayed application period." ;
    cof:pageNumber "40"^^xsd:integer .

