concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18be a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18BE Revoking the approval of an approved privacy code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-18be ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may revoke his or her approval of an approved privacy code or a variation of an approved privacy code:  (a) on his or her own initiative; or  (b) on application by an organisation that is bound by the code.  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (2) Before deciding whether to revoke the approval of a code or variation, the Commissioner must:  (a) if practicable, consult the organisation that originally sought approval of the code or variation; and  (b) consult any other person the Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (c) consider the extent to which members of the public have been given an opportunity to comment on the proposed revocation.  (3) A revocation must be in writing.  (4) A revocation comes into effect on the day specified in the revocation.  (5) The day specified must not be before the day on which the revocation is made." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may revoke his or her approval of an approved privacy code or a variation of an approved privacy code:  (a) on his or her own initiative; or  (b) on application by an organisation that is bound by the code.  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  (2) Before deciding whether to revoke the approval of a code or variation, the Commissioner must:  (a) if practicable, consult the organisation that originally sought approval of the code or variation; and  (b) consult any other person the Commissioner considers appropriate; and  (c) consider the extent to which members of the public have been given an opportunity to comment on the proposed revocation.  (3) A revocation must be in writing.  (4) A revocation comes into effect on the day specified in the revocation.  (5) The day specified must not be before the day on which the revocation is made."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cee9db690a1645451b6d21650a07dcdbbb232714eb4353a2ee41ee2299493763" ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18be-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18be-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18be-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18be-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18be-ss-5 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
