concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18bh a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18BH Review of operation of approved privacy code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-18bh ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of an approved privacy code. Note: The review may inform a decision by the Commissioner under section 18BE to revoke the approved privacy code.  (2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the purposes of the review:  (a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing with complaints;  (b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;  (c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the code;  (d) interview an adjudicator for the code." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of an approved privacy code. Note: The review may inform a decision by the Commissioner under section 18BE to revoke the approved privacy code.  (2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the purposes of the review:  (a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing with complaints;  (b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;  (c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the code;  (d) interview an adjudicator for the code."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6e45bedd5da3ce72a58fd761253d37e0961684777d09b18b0b8dd1e32d03f7cf" ;
    cof:pageNumber "48"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18bh-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18bh-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
