concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95 Subsection 52(3A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-95 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in subsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or (ii) that concerns a breach of:  (a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or  (b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (d) section 18J.  (3B) A determination may include an order that:  (a) an agency or respondent make an appropriate correction, deletion or addition to a record, or to a credit information file or credit report, as the case may be; or  (b) an agency or respondent attach to a record, or include in a credit information file or credit report, as the case may be, a statement provided by the complainant of a correction, deletion or addition sought by the complainant." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in subsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or (ii) that concerns a breach of:  (a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or  (b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (d) section 18J.  (3B) A determination may include an order that:  (a) an agency or respondent make an appropriate correction, deletion or addition to a record, or to a credit information file or credit report, as the case may be; or  (b) an agency or respondent attach to a record, or include in a credit information file or credit report, as the case may be, a statement provided by the complainant of a correction, deletion or addition sought by the complainant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3da5b7ebd043c87d69abc790b9648a6784dc637a2a7338cbf2ccffae98741522" ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95-ss-3a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95-ss-3b ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.57" .
doc:sch-1-sec-95 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "95 Subsection 52(3A)" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in subsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or (ii) that concerns a breach of:  (a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or  (b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (d) section 18J.  (3B) A determination may include an order that:  (a) an agency or respondent make an appropriate correction, deletion or addition to a record, or to a credit information file or credit report, as the case may be; or  (b) an agency or respondent attach to a record, or include in a credit information file or credit report, as the case may be, a statement provided by the complainant of a correction, deletion or addition sought by the complainant." ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95-ss-3a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95(3A) Subsection 52(3A)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-95-ss-3a ;
    values:originalText "(3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in subsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or (ii) that concerns a breach of:  (a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or  (b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (d) section 18J." ;
    skos:definition "(3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in subsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or (ii) that concerns a breach of:  (a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or  (b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (d) section 18J."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "54e624d8e9e069797340be93b9807038422999ad76b8d5cf5877cbbbb7b64c63" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95 ;
    cof:pageNumber "57"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner may include an order in a determination concerning breach of certain privacy principles." ;
