    cof:title "95(3A) Subsection 52(3A)" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in subsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or (ii) that concerns a breach of:  (a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or  (b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with the correction of personal information; or  (d) section 18J." ;
