doc:sch-1-sec-53a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "53A(1) Notice to be given to outsourcing agency" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Commissioner makes a determination to which a contracted service provider for a Commonwealth contract is the respondent, the Commissioner:  (a) must give a copy of the determination to each agency:  (i) to which services are or were to be provided under the contract; and  (ii) to which the Commissioner considers it appropriate to give a copy; and  (b) may give such an agency a written recommendation of any measures that the Commissioner considers appropriate." ;
    cof:pageNumber "58"^^xsd:integer .

