concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "53B(3) Substituting respondent to determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Before making a determination, the Commissioner must give the agency:  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (a) a notice stating that the Commissioner proposes to make the determination and stating the reasons for the proposal; and  (b) an opportunity to appear before the Commissioner and to make oral and/or written submissions relating to the proposed determination." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Before making a determination, the Commissioner must give the agency:  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (a) a notice stating that the Commissioner proposes to make the determination and stating the reasons for the proposal; and  (b) an opportunity to appear before the Commissioner and to make oral and/or written submissions relating to the proposed determination."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7bca60abf48837cfa41d10a88d58bb6c24d0f3c406559acc2a9bdd2d73b2ea9a" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-53b ;
