concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55 Obligations of respondent organisation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-55-2 ;
    values:originalText "Determination under section 52  (1) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made under section 52:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination under sub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B); and  (b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii).  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  Determination under approved privacy code  (2) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made under an approved privacy code:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination and that corresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a); and  (b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination and that corresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(b)." ;
    skos:definition "Determination under section 52  (1) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made under section 52:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination under sub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B); and  (b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii).  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  Determination under approved privacy code  (2) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made under an approved privacy code:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination and that corresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a); and  (b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination and that corresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(b)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "983d9d54cda35be6a06b868066c65150b71025cabf6132562591f9538ee9dcda" ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.60" .
doc:sch-1-sec-55-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55 Obligations of respondent organisation" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Determination under section 52  (1) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made under section 52:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination under sub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B); and  (b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination under subparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii).  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1  Determination under approved privacy code  (2) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made under an approved privacy code:  (a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination and that corresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a); and  (b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by a declaration that is included in the determination and that corresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(b)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer .

