doc:sch-1-sec-55b-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "55B(3) Evidentiary certificate" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) In any proceedings under section 55A, a certificate under subsection (1) or (2) of this section is prima facie evidence of the facts found by the Commissioner or adjudicator and set out in the certificate. However, the certificate is not prima facie evidence of a finding that:  (a) a specified agency had breached an Information Privacy Principle; or  (b) a specified organisation had breached an approved privacy code or a National Privacy Principle." ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "55B(4) Evidentiary certificate"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-55b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A document purporting to be a certificate under subsection (1) or (2) must, unless the contrary is established, be taken to be a certificate and to have been properly given." ;
    skos:definition "(4) A document purporting to be a certificate under subsection (1) or (2) must, unless the contrary is established, be taken to be a certificate and to have been properly given."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c52eb5b6814a9c8423974608bdfcb0908b27aa79d00ad0d83f7422213e5ef040" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55b ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Document purporting to be a certificate must be taken as a valid certificate unless proven otherwise." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
