concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-68a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68A Identity cards"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-68a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Commissioner must issue to a person authorised for the purposes of section 68 an identity card in the form approved by the Commissioner. The identity card must contain a recent photograph of the authorised person.  (2) As soon as practicable after the person ceases to be authorised, he or she must return the identity card to the Commissioner.  (3) A person must not contravene subsection (2). Penalty: 1 penalty unit." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Commissioner must issue to a person authorised for the purposes of section 68 an identity card in the form approved by the Commissioner. The identity card must contain a recent photograph of the authorised person.  (2) As soon as practicable after the person ceases to be authorised, he or she must return the identity card to the Commissioner.  (3) A person must not contravene subsection (2). Penalty: 1 penalty unit."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5a9e424a958b59e24a56905f56b50355b83be5567458a5bbd41a237c8adb5c74" ;
    cof:pageNumber "65"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-68a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-68a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-68a-ss-3 ;
