doc:sch-1-sec-118-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "118(2) At the end of section 72" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subject to this Division, if the Commissioner is satisfied that:  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (a) an act or practice of an organisation breaches, or may breach, an approved privacy code, or a National Privacy Principle, that binds the organisation; but  (b) the public interest in the organisation doing the act, or engaging in the practice, substantially outweighs the public interest in adhering to that code or Principle; the Commissioner may make a written determination to that effect. Effect of determination under subsection (2)" ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer .

