concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-118-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "118(4) At the end of section 72"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-118-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Commissioner may make a written determination that no organisation is taken to contravene section 16A if, while that determination is in force, an organisation does an act, or engages in a practice, that is the subject of a determination under subsection (2) in relation to that organisation or any other organisation. Effect of determination under subsection (4)" ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Commissioner may make a written determination that no organisation is taken to contravene section 16A if, while that determination is in force, an organisation does an act, or engages in a practice, that is the subject of a determination under subsection (2) in relation to that organisation or any other organisation. Effect of determination under subsection (4)"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4c7f77e389a0bd43c96f7265b8358dbb07756c4ae32928a3f0b8a3f2e6774adf" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-118 ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Commissioner's written determination that no organisation contravenes section 16A" ;
