    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if the Commissioner is satisfied that:  (a) the act or practice of an agency or organisation that is the subject of an application under section 73 for a determination under section 72 breaches, or may breach:  (i) in the case of an agency—an Information Privacy Principle; and  (ii) in the case of an organisation—an approved privacy code, or a National Privacy Principle, that binds the organisation; and  (b) the public interest in the agency or organisation doing the act, or engaging in the practice, outweighs to a substantial degree the public interest in adhering to that Principle or code; and  (c) the application raises issues that require an urgent decision." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This section applies if the Commissioner is satisfied that:  (a) the act or practice of an agency or organisation that is the subject of an application under section 73 for a determination under section 72 breaches, or may breach:  (i) in the case of an agency—an Information Privacy Principle; and  (ii) in the case of an organisation—an approved privacy code, or a National Privacy Principle, that binds the organisation; and  (b) the public interest in the agency or organisation doing the act, or engaging in the practice, outweighs to a substantial degree the public interest in adhering to that Principle or code; and  (c) the application raises issues that require an urgent decision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5813857e30b7879ad3780e578f206535dba26d7169b4a16669cb044f3193c678" ;
