doc:sch-1-sec-80a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "80A(1) Temporary public interest determinations" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) This section applies if the Commissioner is satisfied that:  (a) the act or practice of an agency or organisation that is the subject of an application under section 73 for a determination under section 72 breaches, or may breach:  (i) in the case of an agency—an Information Privacy Principle; and  (ii) in the case of an organisation—an approved privacy code, or a National Privacy Principle, that binds the organisation; and  (b) the public interest in the agency or organisation doing the act, or engaging in the practice, outweighs to a substantial degree the public interest in adhering to that Principle or code; and  (c) the application raises issues that require an urgent decision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-80a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80A(2) Temporary public interest determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Commissioner may make a written temporary public interest determination that he or she is satisfied of the matters set out in subsection (1). The Commissioner may do so:  (a) on request by the agency or organisation; or  (b) on the Commissioner’s own initiative." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Commissioner may make a written temporary public interest determination that he or she is satisfied of the matters set out in subsection (1). The Commissioner may do so:  (a) on request by the agency or organisation; or  (b) on the Commissioner’s own initiative."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c4b8d60ee35d8ae0f6edd044175e6d606976bf22e6392e1041ef66ef931c3ed6" ;
    values:partOf concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-80a ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Commissioner may make a written temporary public interest determination." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf> ;
