    skos:definition "(3) The Commissioner may make a written determination that no organisation is taken to contravene section 16A if, while that determination is in force, an organisation does an act, or engages in a practice, that is the subject of a temporary public interest determination in relation to that organisation or another organisation. Effect of determination under subsection (3)"@en ;
