concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-80d a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80D Commissioner may continue to consider application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80d ;
    values:originalText "(1) The fact that the Commissioner has made a determination under this Division about an act or practice does not prevent the Commissioner from dealing under Division 1 with an application made under section 73 in relation to that act or practice.  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (2) A determination under this Division about an act or practice ceases to be in effect when:  (a) a determination made under subsection 72(1) or (2) (as appropriate) about the act or practice comes into effect; or  (b) a determination is made under paragraph 78(b) to dismiss the application." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The fact that the Commissioner has made a determination under this Division about an act or practice does not prevent the Commissioner from dealing under Division 1 with an application made under section 73 in relation to that act or practice.  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  (2) A determination under this Division about an act or practice ceases to be in effect when:  (a) a determination made under subsection 72(1) or (2) (as appropriate) about the act or practice comes into effect; or  (b) a determination is made under paragraph 78(b) to dismiss the application."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "09d26c91c9fbe551d8eaf292374f1b1d70b90279eced58f668bf685b23d8bbd3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "71"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-80d-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-80d-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf> ;
    dc:source "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.71" .
