    values:originalText "(2) For the purposes of subparagraph 2.1(d)(ii) of the NPPs, the Commissioner may, by notice in the Gazette, approve guidelines that relate to the use and disclosure of health information for the purposes of research, or the compilation or analysis of statistics, relevant to public health or public safety. Public interest test" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "95A(3) Guidelines for National Privacy Principles about health"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-95a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commissioner may give an approval under subsection (2) only if satisfied that the public interest in the use and disclosure of health information for the purposes mentioned in that subsection in accordance with the guidelines substantially outweighs the public interest in maintaining the level of privacy protection afforded by the NPPs (other than paragraph 2.1(d)). Approving guidelines for collection" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Commissioner may give an approval under subsection (2) only if satisfied that the public interest in the use and disclosure of health information for the purposes mentioned in that subsection in accordance with the guidelines substantially outweighs the public interest in maintaining the level of privacy protection afforded by the NPPs (other than paragraph 2.1(d)). Approving guidelines for collection"@en ;
