    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-95b-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) This section applies whether the agency is entering into the Commonwealth contract on behalf of the Commonwealth or in the agency’s own right.  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1" ;
    skos:definition "(5) This section applies whether the agency is entering into the Commonwealth contract on behalf of the Commonwealth or in the agency’s own right.  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1"@en ;
