    values:originalText "Insert:  (2A) The report must also include a statement about the operation of approved privacy codes that contain procedures for making and dealing with complaints in relation to acts or practices that may be an interference with the privacy of an individual, including:  (a) action taken by adjudicators to monitor compliance with the codes; and  (b) details about the number of complaints made under codes, their nature and outcome." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (2A) The report must also include a statement about the operation of approved privacy codes that contain procedures for making and dealing with complaints in relation to acts or practices that may be an interference with the privacy of an individual, including:  (a) action taken by adjudicators to monitor compliance with the codes; and  (b) details about the number of complaints made under codes, their nature and outcome."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3ddf47befd09f9d99de2f6b0bce8bb93871b424be078e6af511a4241c7560e3a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report must include statement about approved privacy codes and their operation." ;
    dc:description "Details about complaints made under codes, their nature and outcome." ;
