concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-2-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 3 Subclause 2.1 operates in relation to personal information that an"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-2-4 ;
    values:originalText "organisation that is a body corporate has collected from a related body corporate as if the organisation’s primary purpose of collection of the information were the primary purpose for which the related body corporate collected the information.  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988" ;
    skos:definition "organisation that is a body corporate has collected from a related body corporate as if the organisation’s primary purpose of collection of the information were the primary purpose for which the related body corporate collected the information.  Schedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988"@en ;
