    skos:prefLabel "122A De-registering industry codes and provisions of industry codes"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-122a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACA may remove from the Register of industry codes kept under section 136:  (a) an industry code; or  (b) a provision of an industry code.  (2) An industry code ceases to be registered when it is removed from the Register.  (3) If the ACA removes a provision of an industry code from the Register, this Part has effect in relation to things occurring after the removal of the provision as if the code registered under this Part did not include the provision removed." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACA may remove from the Register of industry codes kept under section 136:  (a) an industry code; or  (b) a provision of an industry code.  (2) An industry code ceases to be registered when it is removed from the Register.  (3) If the ACA removes a provision of an industry code from the Register, this Part has effect in relation to things occurring after the removal of the provision as if the code registered under this Part did not include the provision removed."@en ;
