concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-2-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 At the end of subsection 130(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Note: The ACA may be satisfied that it is necessary or convenient to vary an industry standard that is inconsistent with the National Privacy Principles or an approved privacy code (as defined in the Privacy Act 1988), following advice given by the Privacy Commissioner in the exercise of his or her functions under that Act." ;
    skos:definition "Add: Note: The ACA may be satisfied that it is necessary or convenient to vary an industry standard that is inconsistent with the National Privacy Principles or an approved privacy code (as defined in the Privacy Act 1988), following advice given by the Privacy Commissioner in the exercise of his or her functions under that Act."@en ;
