concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-4-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-4-4 ;
    values:originalText "The amendment of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this Schedule applies for the purposes of determining the operation of that Act in relation to an act or practice, regardless of whether the act or practice occurred before or after the commencement of this Schedule.   Disclosures to intelligence bodies  Schedule 3  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 12 April 2000 Senate on 28 November 2000]  (54/00)" ;
